<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $500 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $500 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ  LRPGG.F</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    05.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX/SING  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT JAN 2002 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
